  "title": "I Want to Change Money for Renminbi",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2023-08-24",
  "synopsis": "How do you change money for renminbi when you arrive in China? Let’s take a look with Amy!\r\nThis lesson focuses on learning how to change money and ask about exchange rates.",
