  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我想换人民币\n\n爱米：你好！我想换一些人民币。\n工作人员：好的，没问题。请问我能看一下你的护照吗？\n爱米：好的。给你。\n工作人员：谢谢！请问，你想换多少钱呢？\n爱米：现在一美元能换多少人民币？\n工作人员：现在一美元能换七元人民币。\n爱米：好的，我想换五百美元，给你。\n工作人员：谢谢。五百美元能换三千五百元人民币。给你。\n爱米：谢谢！\n工作人员：不客气。",
    "traditional": "我想換人民幣\n\n愛米：你好！我想換一些人民幣。\n工作人員：好的，沒問題。請問我能看一下你的護照嗎？\n愛米：好的。給你。\n工作人員：謝謝！請問，你想換多少錢呢？\n愛米：現在一美元能換多少人民幣？\n工作人員：現在一美元能換七元人民幣。\n愛米：好的，我想換五百美元，給你。\n工作人員：謝謝。五百美元能換三千五百元人民幣。給你。\n愛米：謝謝！\n工作人員：不客氣。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I Want to Change Money for Renminbi"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "爱米：你好！我想换一些人民币。",
      "traditional": "愛米：你好！我想換一些人民幣。",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ nǐ hǎo wǒ xiǎng huàn yì xiē rén mín bì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy at the airport: Hello! I want to change some money for renminbi."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "工作人员：好的，没问题。请问我能看一下你的护照吗？",
      "traditional": "工作人員：好的，沒問題。請問我能看一下你的護照嗎？",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán hǎo de méi wèn tí qǐng wèn wǒ néng kàn yí xià nǐ de hù zhào ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff member: Okay, no problem. May I see your passport, please?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "爱米：好的。给你。",
      "traditional": "愛米：好的。給你。",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ hǎo de gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Okay. Here you go."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "工作人员：谢谢！请问，你想换多少钱呢？",
      "traditional": "工作人員：謝謝！請問，你想換多少錢呢？",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán xiè xie qǐng wèn nǐ xiǎng huàn duō shao qián ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff member: Thank you! How much do you want to change?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "爱米：现在一美元能换多少人民币？",
      "traditional": "愛米：現在一美元能換多少人民幣？",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ xiàn zài yī měi yuán néng huàn duō shao rén mín bì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: How many renminbi can I exchange one US dollar for now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "工作人员：现在一美元能换七元人民币。",
      "traditional": "工作人員：現在一美元能換七元人民幣。",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán xiàn zài yì měi yuán néng huàn qī yuán rén mín bì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff member: You can exchange one US dollar for seven renminbi now."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "爱米：好的，我想换五百美元，给你。",
      "traditional": "愛米：好的，我想換五百美元，給你。",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ hǎo de wǒ xiǎng huàn wǔ bǎi měi yuán gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Okay, I’d like to exchange 500 US dollars. Here you go."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "工作人员：谢谢。五百美元能换三千五百元人民币。给你。",
      "traditional": "工作人員：謝謝。五百美元能換三千五百元人民幣。給你。",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán xiè xie wǔ bǎi měi yuán néng huàn sān qiān wǔ bǎi yuán rén mín bì gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff member: Thank you. You can exchange 500 US dollars for 3,500 renminbi. Here you go."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "爱米：谢谢！",
      "traditional": "愛米：謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "工作人员：不客气。",
      "traditional": "工作人員：不客氣。",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán bú kè qi",
      "english": ""
    }
